# Git worker secrets (auxiliary/git/wrangler.jsonc)
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in the values.

# PEM-encoded ECDSA P-256 public key for JWT verification.
# The main worker signs JWTs with the corresponding private key;
# this worker only needs the public key to verify them.
#
# Generate an ES256 key pair with:
#   openssl ecparam -name prime256v1 -genkey -noout -out ec-private.pem
#   openssl ec -in ec-private.pem -pubout -out ec-public.pem
#
# Then paste the contents of ec-public.pem here (keep the newlines or
# join into a single line — the code strips PEM headers and whitespace).
JWT_PUBLIC_KEY=
